   121	
   122	| Date | What leaked into a run log | Fix |
   123	|---|---|---|
   124	| 2026-11-19 | Environment variables printed by AndroidWorld's setup (an API key, a session token) | Redacted in every commit (`git filter-branch`) |
   125	| 2026-11-20 | An expired Colab file-proxy token inside a download URL | Redacted in every commit (`git filter-branch`) |
   126	
   127	- Old → new commit hashes: [history-rewrites.md](history-rewrites.md).
   128	- A scan of every file in every pushed commit (including compressed episode files) finds no credentials. It
   129	  checked cloud keys, Hugging Face / OpenAI / Anthropic / GitHub / Google / Modal tokens, private keys, JWTs and
   130	  `*_KEY`/`*_TOKEN`/`*_SECRET`/`*_PASSWORD` values.
   131	- New log commits are redacted automatically: `.gitattributes` applies the `redact-env` clean filter to `*.log`.
   132	  It needs a one-time local setup:
   133	
   134	```bash
   135	git config filter.redact-env.clean "LC_ALL=C sed -E -e \"s/'([A-Z0-9_]*(KEY|TOKEN|SECRET|PASSWORD)[A-Z0-9_]*)': '[^']*'/'\\\\1': '<redacted>'/g\" -e 's/eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]{15,}[.]eyJ[A-Za-z0-9_-]{15,}[.][A-Za-z0-9_-]{10,}/<redacted-token>/g'"
   136	git config filter.redact-env.smudge cat
   137	```
