      "| Model | AC high-level | AC low-level | 'complete' acc | AndroidWorld | latency / prompt | General knowledge |",
      "|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|"] + rows
open(os.path.join(R, "SUMMARY.md"), "w").write("\n".join(md) + "\n")
