# Research

Literature reviews written during the project (multi-agent deep research). They record what was known and planned
at the time; numbers in them are from that moment, and links to files may use the old layout
([repository.md](../repository.md)).

| Report | Written | Question | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| [Small GUI agent training methods](small-gui-agent-training-methods.md) | 2026-11-17 | Which training methods (offline RFT, online RL, self-improvement data) could lift a 2B screenshot agent | [notes/small-gui-agent-training-methods/](notes/small-gui-agent-training-methods/) |
| [Beating GUI-Owl at 2B fairly](beating-gui-owl-at-2b-fairly.md) | 2026-11-18 | How GUI-Owl-1.5-2B was trained, what is tunable, and how to compare fairly | [notes/beating-gui-owl-at-2b-fairly/](notes/beating-gui-owl-at-2b-fairly/) |

What the project did with them: [models.md](../models.md) (v4 and v4-RL), [evaluation.md](../evaluation.md)
(matched harness).
# logs/

Run logs kept as evidence; they are not edited, except that values looking like keys or tokens are redacted on
commit (`redact-env` filter, see [docs/repository.md](../docs/repository.md#secrets-and-history-rewrites)).
Operational noise (session launches, keep-alive, polling) was removed on 2026-11-20 and is at tag
`archive/pre-restructure-2026-11-20`.

| Files | Evidence for |
|---|---|
| `llama_server_<model or arm>.log` | Exact model-server flags, model files and per-request timings of each run |
| `aw_run_<model>.log` | Seed-30 AndroidWorld runs (full runner output) |
| `aw_sealed_<arm>_seed7.log` | The first two held-out arms (logs written by the first sealed runner) |
| `local_sealed_<arm>_seed<s>.log`, `local_sealed_queue_emu*.log` | Held-out arm launches and queues (progress only; outcomes stayed inside the sealed folders) |
| `local_aw_rerun_<arm>_seed<s>.log`, `local_aw_queue_emu*_rerun.log` | The preregistered single re-runs |
| `aw_emu_guard_<port>.log` | Emulator liveness guard during re-runs (it never fired) |
| `emulator_aw*.log`, `aw_emulator*_setup.log` | Emulator output, including the 2026-11-19 hang and restart |
| `*_jobs_cell*.log`, `modal_*.log`, `v3_*.log` | Training and offline-eval jobs on Colab and Modal |
| `codex_*.log` | Codex audit sessions (the reports are in `results/codex/`) |
| `gcp_mw_*.log`, `mw_pull_r2_full.log`, `colab_failover.log` | MobileWorld run 2 and its model servers |
| `qdc_*`, `devstream_*` | Phone speed benchmarks |
| `maiui_q8_sha256.txt`, `colab_maiui_q8_attestation.txt` | Proof that the MAI-UI model files served in the cloud match the Mac's |
# results/

Raw results and the summaries computed from them. Summaries are regenerated by [`../analysis/`](../analysis/);
raw files are never edited. What each number means: [docs/results.md](../docs/results.md).

## Headline summaries

| File | What |
|---|---|
| `sealed_analysis_final.{md,json}` | **Held-out AndroidWorld, preregistered analysis** (3 seeds) |
| `sealed_sensitivity_final.{md,json}` | Held-out AndroidWorld sensitivity analyses |
| `androidworld/dev_seed30_summary.{md,json}` | Development seed 30: every model's score and Apple M5 speed |
| `mobileworld/mw_r2_comparison.{md,json}` | MobileWorld: v4 vs GUI-Owl vs MAI-UI |
| `speed/speed_t8.md`, `qdc/speed_qdc_v6.md` | Speed on CPU and on the phone |
| `SUMMARY.md`, `V2_COMPARISON.md` | Offline AndroidControl, dev splits, general knowledge |
| `v4_gate_seed30.txt`, `v4rl_promotion_offline.json` | v4 gate (pass) and v4-RL promotion (fail) |

## Supporting files

| File | What |
|---|---|
| `aw_checker_disputes.json` | Checker successes the saved screenshots contradict (sensitivity only) |
| `aw_template_manifest.json` | The 78 AndroidWorld templates whose goal text can change with the seed |
| `v4_dev_reference.json`, `v4_gate_v3_pin.json` | Pinned inputs the gate checks against |
| `v4_local_export_manifest.json`, `v4rl_local_export_manifest.json` | Hashes of the exported model files |
| `maiui_quant_check.md` | Why MAI-UI runs at 8-bit (its 4-bit output degenerates) |
| `sealed_analysis_seed7*.{md,json}` | Interim seed-7-only outputs, kept as the record of that stage |

## Folders

| Folder | Contents |
|---|---|
| `androidworld_sealed/` | **Held-out episode files** (`<model>_seed<s>/`, re-runs in `*_rerun/`) |
| `androidworld/` | Seed-30 episode files, one folder per model, + per-run summaries; `_*` folders are smoke tests and discarded runs |
| `mobileworld/` | MobileWorld per-model summaries, run snapshot, container logs. Raw trajectories (`traj_r2/`, 8.6 GB) are not in git |
| `androidcontrol/` | AndroidControl test predictions and metrics |
| `general/` | General-knowledge (MMStar, MMLU) predictions and retention tests |
| `v2_dev/`, `v3_dev/`, `v4_dev/`, `v4rl_dev/` | Development-split predictions and metrics per version (v4: also training logs) |
| `vm_backup/` | Copies of v4 / v4-RL dev outputs taken off the training VM |
| `training/` | Training logs, configs and loss curves per run |
| `speed/`, `qdc/`, `devstream/` | Raw speed measurements: CPU, Qualcomm phone, Pixel 9 |
| `data/`, `data_v2/` | Dataset verification and build logs |
| `codex/` | Codex audits: `PROMPT_<name>.md` + report + evidence ([docs/audits.md](../docs/audits.md)) |

Episode files (`*.pkl.gz`) are Python pickles written by this project's AndroidWorld harness; load them only from
this repository.

