   154	- **What-if, not a bound:** if MAI-UI had solved the 5 tasks it lost to final setup failures, it would score 16
   155	  vs GUI-Owl's 22 (p = 0.26). GUI-Owl and v4 solved none of those 5.
   156	- MAI-UI ran last, on recreated containers after two spot-VM preemptions. Its emulators crashed with a fatal KVM
