   169	### Harness notes (disclosed, not corrected)
   170	
   171	- **No user simulator:** `ask_user` needs an LLM-backed simulator this setup lacks. GUI-Owl hit it in 7 executions
   172	  and MAI-UI in 14. v4 has no such action.
   173	- **Typing and Enter cost v4 rounds:** its adapter sends Enter as an extra round after typing. In 3 tasks the
   174	  Enter fell on round 50 and was never sent. 37 tasks that hit the budget had fewer than 50 model decisions.
   175	- **One task fails for every model:** ThanksgivingPrepTask setup failed on every attempt.
   176	- **Discarded runs:** v4's first run (5/105) used an adapter that changed v4's scroll and Enter behaviour, so it is
   177	  not counted. GUI-Owl's first run lost its model server after 4 tasks and was discarded.
