    25	---
    26	
    27	## Training recipe
    28	
    29	Every LFM3-VL-2B version uses the same recipe and budget, so data and prompt are the only things that change.
    30	
    31	| Setting | Value |
    32	|---|---|
    33	| Method | LoRA SFT on the language model only; vision tower frozen |
    34	| LoRA | rank 64, alpha 128; attention, MLP and convolution projections |
    35	| Optimiser | lr 2e-4, 1,250 steps × 32 rows (batch 8 × gradient accumulation 4) |
    36	| Image | One screenshot per step, area budget 880 × 880 px (≈ 720 image tokens for a phone screen) |
    37	| Input | Goal + text history of earlier steps + current screenshot (v4: + installed-app list) |
    38	| Output | `<think>short intent</think>` + one JSON action, coordinates on a 0–1000 grid |
    39	| Checkpoints | Pushed to the Hub every 50 steps so a lost VM can resume |
    40	
    41	Code: [`train/sft_vlm.py`](../train/sft_vlm.py), prompt and action format in
    42	[`train/agent_format.py`](../train/agent_format.py), job configs in
    43	[`scripts/training/jobs/`](../scripts/training/jobs/).
    44	
    45	### Action space
    46	
    47	`click`, `long_press`, `input_text` (types, then presses Enter), `scroll` (up/down/left/right), `open_app`,
    48	`navigate_back`, `navigate_home`, `keyboard_enter`, `wait`, `answer` (v4), `status` (`complete` / `infeasible`).
