    91	
    92	## Rules this project kept
    93	
    94	- **No AndroidWorld data in training:** no AndroidWorld tasks, variants, trajectories or checkers in any training set.
    95	- **Fair harness:** same screenshot budget, step budget, quantisation and app list for the compared models.
    96	- **Sealed held-out seeds:** results of seeds 7/1234/2026 were not read until every model had finished that seed.
    97	- **Every deviation is dated** in [docs/PREREG_v4.md](docs/PREREG_v4.md), with what had and had not been seen at the time.
    98	- **Exceptions count as failures**, unlike AndroidWorld's default.
     1	# Reproduce
     2	
     3	## Recompute every reported number (minutes, no GPU)
     4	
     5	```bash
     6	git clone git@github.com:alpharomercoma/lfm3-android-runs.git && cd lfm3-android-runs
