    10	The script re-runs every script in [`analysis/`](../analysis/) and checks that each output matches the committed one.
    11	
    12	| What is recomputed | From |
    13	|---|---|
    14	| AndroidWorld held-out and seed-30 scores, tests, sensitivity, M5 speed | Episode files (`*.pkl.gz`) in `results/androidworld_sealed/` and `results/androidworld/` |
    15	| v4 gate, v4-RL promotion, offline tables | Prediction and metric files in `results/v4_dev/`, `results/v4rl_dev/`, `results/androidcontrol/`, `results/general/` |
    16	| Speed (CPU, phones) | Raw request logs in `results/speed/`, `results/qdc/`, `results/devstream/` |
    17	| MobileWorld | **Skipped** unless `results/mobileworld/traj_r2/` exists. The 8.6 GB of raw trajectories are not in git; the per-task summaries are |
    18	
    19	The episode files are Python pickles written by this project's own AndroidWorld harness. Load them only from this
    20	repository.
    21	
    22	## Re-run the experiments
    23	
    24	These need hardware and accounts the analysis does not:
    25	
    26	| Experiment | Needs | Entry point |
    27	|---|---|---|
    28	| Training (SFT) | One GPU (peak use ~11.5 GB; runs used Colab A100 / L4 / G4 and Modal A100 / H100); Hugging Face access to the datasets | [`train/sft_vlm.py`](../train/sft_vlm.py); job configs in [`scripts/training/jobs/`](../scripts/training/jobs/) |
    29	| AndroidControl offline eval | GPU | [`eval/androidcontrol/generate.py`](../eval/androidcontrol/generate.py) → [`score.py`](../eval/androidcontrol/score.py) |
    30	| AndroidWorld | AndroidWorld @ `55ddaf5` cloned to `android_world/` + the two patches in `eval/androidworld/`; Android SDK emulator (API 33); llama.cpp | [`scripts/androidworld/local_sealed_aw_v3.sh`](../scripts/androidworld/local_sealed_aw_v3.sh) `<arm> <seed> <console port> <grpc port> <server port>` |
    31	| MobileWorld | A Linux host with KVM; MobileWorld @ `a026188`; a GPU host for the model server | [`scripts/mobileworld/`](../scripts/mobileworld/) |
    32	| Speed | llama.cpp `cd959bae9` (b12110); the GGUF files | [`scripts/speed/bench_speed.sh`](../scripts/speed/bench_speed.sh) |
    33	
    34	Model files (GGUF) live in the Hugging Face repositories listed in [models.md](models.md#released-artifacts).
    35	Local paths in the scripts (`models/`, `tools/`, `android_world/`) are git-ignored.
