results/codex/final_heldout_audit/execution_review.md:50:The v1/2026 relaunch started 10:04 and finished 13:20:45. The failed 5558 attempt contains no `Running task:` or checkpoint record. GUI-Owl/1234 resumed the same run directory at 18:07, skipped the 33 already saved episodes and restarted the interrupted MarkorMergeNotes. Its repeated task enumerations are not repeated execution: the log explicitly says `Skipping already processed task`. Exactly one result was written for each template. v1/7's planned pause in the 02:35 entry did not actually occur: its single run proceeds 01:30–06:32; the later GUI-Owl/1234 arm was the one paused for development. This is a chronology clarification, not score selection.
