+| Duplicate fixture/backup paths in F30 | Prefer a short evidence index and a shared fixture source over repeated full directory trees. Preserve immutable audit snapshots through the archive tag and repair references before consolidating. Do not remove the live `answer_tasks.json`, split manifests, raw episodes, predictions or source receipts needed by analysis. |
